IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

§ `Model Constitutions — shared domain`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Companies (Model Constitutions) Regulations 2015 (S 833/2015) —
-- shared types for both the First Schedule (private company limited
-- by shares) and the Second Schedule (company limited by guarantee).
--
-- Source: SSO current version as at 07 Sep 2026.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `Constitution types`

DECLARE `Constitution Type` IS ONE OF
    `private company limited by shares`
    `company limited by guarantee`
